      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're not just feeling lost, you're feeling irrelevant. The idea that everything we do is just noise in a vacuum can be overwhelming, especially when it feels like no one or nothing is paying attention. It's natural to wonder if the struggles and pains are even worth it if they're just going to be erased in the grand scheme. But, it's also possible that the fact that you're feeling this way is what makes you exist - it's a sign that you're still here, still experiencing, still struggling.",
